cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "anaerobic-chamber-code: firmware and monitoring software for AnaeroLab"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-15
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/dstrbad/anaerobic-chamber-code"
abstract: >-
  Firmware and monitoring software for AnaeroLab, an open-source anaerobic
  chamber with continuous environmental monitoring and layered safety control.
  Includes the Arduino Mega 2560 firmware (sensing, gas handling, heater control
  and safety logic), the Arduino Nano ESP32 Wi-Fi/MQTT bridge, a Python
  MQTT-to-CSV data collector, a browser-based dashboard and the Docker
  configuration for the monitoring stack. Version 1.0.0 is the version described
  in the accompanying HardwareX article.
keywords:
